virt-viewer: Virt Viewer provides a graphical viewer for the guest OS
virt-viewer: display. At this time is supports guest OS using the VNC
virt-viewer: or SPICE protocols. Further protocols may be supported in
virt-viewer: the future as user demand dictates. The viewer can connect
virt-viewer: directly to both local and remotely hosted guest OS, optionally
virt-viewer: using SSL/TLS encryption.
